This tree is TensorFold 1.0.2 as modified by Fiore-lab.
Copyright 2026 Fiore-lab

Fiore-lab added the engine of full GLM-5.3 for DGX Spark (zig/src/families/glm_moe_dsa/,
zig/kernels/cuda/glm53/, zig/native/, zig/src/native/glm53_host.zig, zig/src/cuda/cublas.zig,
zig/src/cuda/tp.zig, zig/tests/cuda/glm53_*.zig, zig/tests/cuda/tp_main.zig, glm53/) and
changed these TensorFold files, each of which says so in its first lines:

  build.zig
  tools/release/package.sh
  zig/build/dist.zig
  zig/build/cuda.zig
  zig/src/core/direct_io.zig
  zig/src/core/engine_api.zig
  zig/src/cuda/abi.zig
  zig/src/cuda/graph.zig
  zig/src/cuda/kernels.zig
  zig/src/cuda/module.zig
  zig/src/cuda/nccl.zig
  zig/src/cuda/root.zig
  zig/src/cuda/stream.zig
  zig/src/native/cuda.zig
  zig/src/server/chat.zig
  zig/src/server/metrics.zig
  zig/src/server/openai.zig
  zig/src/server/routes.zig
  zig/src/server/serve.zig
  zig/src/server/server.zig
  zig/src/server/status_routes.zig
  zig/src/server/stream_preflight_test.zig
  zig/src/server/tool_parse.zig
  zig/src/server/tool_parse_test.zig

direct_io.zig, tool_parse.zig and tool_parse_test.zig are TensorFold's own later versions (commits e561a257 and
c126fe16: a test's reference read, and GLM tool calls read when the model drops an <arg_key> or the end token leaves
a value open), taken in unchanged apart from their first line.

Fiore-lab's published tree leaves out TensorFold's documents; its README*.md and packaging/RUNTIME*.md (English,
Japanese and Simplified Chinese) are Fiore-lab's, and Fiore-lab added the sections "Full GLM-5.3 in Zig" and
"Unicode data" to THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The additions include code from TensorFold's Python engine and from b12x, some of it
modified by Fiore-lab, as THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists. The additions are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. What they take from
other projects is listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md under "Full GLM-5.3 in Zig".
